Credits: Eclipse Zenoh
----------------------

tiny-zenoh-go is an independent Go implementation of the Zenoh protocol.
It reproduces the algorithms, wire formats, configuration formats and
behaviour of Eclipse Zenoh, and owes its design to that project:

  * Project home: https://projects.eclipse.org/projects/iot.zenoh
  * Website:      https://zenoh.io
  * zenoh-rust:   https://github.com/eclipse-zenoh/zenoh
  * zenoh-pico:   https://github.com/eclipse-zenoh/zenoh-pico
  * Protocol specification: https://spec.zenoh.io

