Third-party content
-------------------

  * github.com/quic-go/quic-go (MIT License), used by link/quic only.
  * golang.org/x/sys, golang.org/x/net, golang.org/x/crypto
    (BSD-3-Clause), via quic-go and for Linux system calls.

LZ4, XXH3 and SipHash are implemented here from their published
specifications (LZ4 and xxHash by Yann Collet; SipHash by Jean-Philippe
Aumasson and Daniel J. Bernstein); no code from their reference
implementations is included.
